+# TLS Certificate Verification
+
+The project's current recorded decision is that TLS certificate verification is enforced on all builds, development builds included, so that certificate problems surface early rather than only in production. Testing that needs a certificate uses self-signed certificates, which keeps verification switched on without depending on an external certificate authority.
